;; ADR 0097 tier-1). This is a DRAFT living under the spike dir; it is not
;; wired into the loader / coreaot yet (see VERDICT.md integration steps).
;;
;; Upstream: org.clojure/data.csv 1.1.0, clojure/data/csv.clj (Jonas Enlund).
;; EPL-1.0 — header preserved below.
